---
description: Keep PingPong Manager UI rectangular, dense, and readable. No decorative slop.
globs: styles/**/*.css, src/ui/**/*.js, index.html
---

# Unslop UI (this game)

- Rectangles only. No parallelograms, no `clip-path: polygon(...)` on buttons, logos, crests, pills, or rank chips.
- Fill the viewport: country/club pickers use large cards, not tiny tiles in empty dark space.
- Flags are inline SVG (`src/ui/flags.js`), never emoji regional indicators (Windows WebView2 shows letters).
- Preseason is a single flow. Hide the club rail. Status chips are display-only; prev/next sit at the top of the step.
- Do not invent a second visual language. Stay on the existing dark-carbon skin.
